❓ FAQ
Why Jetpack Compose?

To build modern, reusable and state-driven Android interfaces.

Why Room?

For reliable local persistence and reactive database access.

Why MVVM?

To separate UI state management from business and data layers.

Why AI?

AI can assist with categorization, summaries and intelligent interactions.

Is AI financial advice?

No. AI features are intended as assistive functionality and should not be treated as professional financial advice.

